{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Do not claim all operation reordering fails fast.** Validation compares only `type`, `sub_type`, `name`, and `parent_id` at each position-derived operation ID. Swapping operations with identical identities\u2014such as two unnamed steps under the same parent\u2014passes validation and can consume the wrong checkpoints. Qualify this guarantee and explicitly prohibit reordering operations while executions are in flight, even when their compared identities match.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7qPctf","finding_digest":"25eeac8dff333071c4c1b46d3e9e6e79c8e82bec0080d2fd6aba20a522a8ab0d","finding_id":"arf_v1_exxkzdp7gmyhdrgbwrwt5htoph","finding_key":"docs/migration-1.x-to-2.0.md::replay-validates-operation-identity::identical-reorder-detection","identity_key":"docs/migration-1.x-to-2.0.md::replay-validates-operation-identity::identical-reorder-detection","line":220,"observation_digest":"c0881d407b8689546a0c75313d261b310696ac8c4e349495a2600d8a7a699ee9","observation_id":"aro_v1_yceb2qd3q2evi2qmouyt2jq3ge","path":"docs/migration-1.x-to-2.0.md","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-04T00:44:06Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ubyo3pfiecnisputvf5krbkqex","reviewed_base_sha":"38d94dc98bc73826b6d2eb978d65f6eeb9169ad1","reviewed_head_sha":"c26de4d91a7af99c4b0b458a751e35497de6afc3","reviewer":"codex","start_line":218,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":655},"record_id":"art_v1_vame72i25pa3hk7enrjbzbv6tl","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-04T00:44:06Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
